# Google OAuth Configuration
# Get your Google Client ID from Google Cloud Console: https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 1. Create a new project or select an existing one
# 2. Enable Google+ API
# 3. Create OAuth 2.0 credentials
# 4. Copy the Client ID and paste it below
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id-here.apps.googleusercontent.com
